  "notes": [
    "The official directories listed 33 entries when checked.",
    "The Vietnamese directory renders the same Latin operator names as the English directory.",
    "The two Endministrator entries are retained separately using their official directory asset keys.",
    "Directory presence is verified; release or playable availability is not asserted.",
    "Hán-Việt names are generated search aliases from the official Simplified Chinese names. They are not official Vietnamese localization.",
    "Rarity presentation follows the documented headhunting colors: 4-star blue, 5-star gold, and 6-star red.",
    "Class, element, equippable weapon type, and race were cross-checked against current operator records and in-game profile transcriptions on 2026-08-24. The shared UI labels class as Role.",
    "Subrace is optional and records only an explicitly attested Sarkaz tribe. It is not inferred from appearance; currently verified values are Djall for Liino, Vampire for Camille, and Nachzehrer for Last Rite.",
    "The Endministrator's race is officially redacted and remains null rather than becoming a filter value.",
    "Official localized names are stored only as searchable aliases when their text differs from the entity's primary English, Simplified Chinese, or Vietnamese name.",
    "The official Spanish locale returned no operator payload when checked, so Spanish names remain unresolved rather than inferred.",
    "Community and web-novel aliases are included only where an attested source was found; absence means no stable alias was verified, not that one cannot exist."
  ],
